  "notes": "pasture_yield = 3 tiles x 625 sq_ft x 4 ton/acre/year / 43560 sq_ft/acre = 7500/43560 ton/year. standing_forage.next = standing_forage + pasture_yield x tick_length, with tick_length 1 day = 24/8760 year. 365 ticks add 365 x 24/8760 = 1 year of it: 7500/43560 = 0.17217631 ton."
